        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Breath Weapon"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The time dragon breathes in one of two ways. The dragon can't use Breath Weapon again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n- **Storm**\n\n- **Traits:** arcane, electricity, evocation\n\nThe dragon breathes a burst of lightning in a 50-foot cone that deals 20d6 electricity damage (42 basic Reflex save).\n- **Time Displacement**\n\n- **Traits:** arcane, transmutation\n\nThe dragon breathes a time storm. Each creature within a 50-foot cone must attempt a 42 Fortitude save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature is stunned 1.\n- **Failure:** The creature is stunned 4.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature is stunned 6."
            },
